@startuml

hide footbox

title US019 - As a User, I want to publicly share a list of mine

box "Tests" #LightYellow
actor User
participant ":UI" as UI
endbox

participant ":ShareListController" as ShareListController
participant ":ListRepo" as ListRepo
participant ":List" as List

User -> UI : Click "Share List"
UI -> ShareListController : requestShareList(listId)
ShareListController -> ListRepo : getList(listId)
ListRepo -> List : loadList(listId)
List --> ListRepo : list
ListRepo --> ShareListController : list

ShareListController -> List : makePublic()
List -> ListRepo : save(list)
ListRepo --> ShareListController : success

ShareListController --> UI : shareConfirmed()
UI --> User : Show public link
@enduml